{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13592","headline":"题巴州光福寺楠木 · 严武","name":"题巴州光福寺楠木","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"楚江长流对楚寺，楠木幽生赤崖背。\n临谿插石盘老根，苔色青苍山雨痕。\n高枝闹叶鸟不度，半掩白云朝与暮。\n香殿萧条转密阴，花龛滴沥垂清露。\n闻道偏多越水头，烟生霁歛使人愁。\n月明忽忆湘川夜，猨呌还思鄂渚秋。\n看君幽霭几千丈，寂寞穷山今遇赏。\n亦知钟梵报黄昏，犹卧禅牀恋奇响。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"严武","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13592.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13592","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}